    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hearaniischooda gadeemga sigeena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gaweay fuga hees bea jeeda buweadeega dooshta Gileyadi, was orjeeda Makiri, orjeeda Manase, orjeeda Yosefu, ak gabalool sea Musa sea fuga hees suurja bea eemeeda Israeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayeesha, “NG'UTAMIIDA gwayeesha ng'utamiideanyu adawa fuga Israeli ng'eanyiida aba ng'alealeeda ak gwahearan; ak ng'utamiideanyu gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA adawa haweega Selofehadi was orjeeda giyeanya hearaniischooda ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaghi fuga eemoojiga suuk bea fuga Israeli, ak abeeda hearaniischooda nyaawa gajeegeanda aba jeeda hearaniischooda ghweanigaasa, ak eemeeni jea eayiin jeeda nyaawaan gajeeheasa hearaniischooda nyaawa; nea hearaniischooni gajeegeanda aba ng'alealeeda aba jeeda hearaniischoodeanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iihita gweaydeaba haradam ea damanamughuush was ghweelmeeda giipkeata bea giighuumdeayda madameega aba fuga Israeli, abeeda hearaniischoodeaba eemeeni mida jeedean gajeahaat hearaniischooda nyaawa; abeeda hearaniischooda nyaawa gajeegeandeawa jeeda hearaniischooda aba jeeda eemeeda ghweanigaasa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukusa Musa fuga Israeli ng'asheega gawuurji gidanyaashta ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwayeesha, “Eemeeda orjooga Yosefu ng'asheega rugu ghwahit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA ng'asheanji aba iita haweega Selofehadi, nea gwayi, ‘Nung'waada ghaghi saawa fuga bwariiy; ak ea daghi fuga jeeda buweadeega eemeeda ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea manda hearaniischooda wassean aba heeda orjooga Israeli jea ghabeawa eemeeni ak gaweesa eamwa suuk; aba gideaba orjooga Israeli gayghwanoas geat ak giliwas sih gaygwahearaniischi aba jeeda eemeeda ghweanigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea giliwas huda jea ghwanyas haleanjeeda jea gwahearan aba jeeda eemeeda wassean aba orjooga Israeli, gajeaghi aba jeeda buweadeega aba eemeanagi bea ghwaan, ak abeeda orjooga Israeli gaba siisi nyas gichea gwahearan bea ghweanigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea manda hearaniischooda wassean jea ghabeawa eemeeni ak gaweesa eamwa suuk; aba gideaba eemeeda orjooga Israeli gaygaba siisi noas hearaniischoadaanyi niny nea gaba geaw.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasinda haweega Selofehadi gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba Mala, ea Dirsa, ea Hogla, ea Milka, ea Nuhu, was haweega Selofehadi gageena orjooga buweadeega ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gageena buweadeega orjooga Manase, was orjeeda Yosefu, nea hearaniischooda nyaawa goobiida jeeda eemeeda buweadeega ghwaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh ng'asheega sirugu gil ea girgweageeda, adaw NG'UTAMIIDA fuga Israeli, aba geatinda Musa, aba jeeda mooheeda ng'eanyiida Moabu, neekeewa Yordani, mida ng'eanyiida eenda Yordani mida Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
